  "query_preview": "..\n(Friday through Thursday)\nIssued at 1130 AM CDT Thu Aug 27 2026\n\nHigh temperatures on Friday will likely be the coolest of the next\nweek though still solidly above seasonal normals. The waning \ninfluence of sfc ridging will give way by Saturday with gusty \nsoutherly winds returning along with a trend for well above normal\ntemperatures. Upper ridge becomes centered more eastward through \nearly next week placing the local region beneath its prevailing \ninfluence through this forecast period. The result will be dry \nand hot weather. Periods of higher heat stress are likely along \nwith continued fire weather concerns during any period of stronger\nwinds.",
